# =============================================================================
#  MMC-CAS.orch - Conversation About a Scene (MPAI-MMC V2.5)
#  Workflow Description Language v0.3, AIF V3.0
#
#  One Controller, one Module. The User Agent offers the Controller data identified by
#  Data Type and Port Number, and asks for data identified the same way. It names no AIM.
#
#  Each turn gives the Module what the camera sees (the scene), what the person says about
#  it (the microphone) and the machine's ID; the Module answers with the Portable Avatar that
#  utters the reply, which takes into account the scene the person speaks about and the object
#  the person indicates in it.
#
#  A step completes before the next begins.
# =============================================================================

workflow MMC-CAS over 1MMC-CAS-V2.5-I01

on Start:

    ask Controller to start

    prompt "Conversation About a Scene: show me a scene and talk with me about it, and about what you point at in it."

    loop until Stop:

        acquire Scene (OSD-BVO-V1.5)
        acquire UserAudio (OSD-BAO-V1.5) via VAD

        offer Scene (OSD-BVO-V1.5:1)
        offer UserAudio (OSD-BAO-V1.5:1)
        offer MachineID (string:1) = "MPAI as a Service"

        ask   MachinePortableAvatar (PAF-PAV-V1.6)
        present MachinePortableAvatar

on Stop:

    ask Controller to stop
